  "title": "Featheral Dollar (FTH$) · Layer-3 currency of Featheral World",
  "description": "Featheral Dollar (FTH$) is the layer-3 currency of Featheral World with its own native, signed block ledger, distributed as daily minified JSON files and bridged to FTHG on Ethereum Mainnet.",
  "body": "<section class=\"hero\">\n  <img class=\"hero-logo\" src=\"/shared/logo-dollar.svg\" alt=\"Featheral feather\" width=\"112\" height=\"112\">\n  <h1 data-cms-copy=\"index-html-2148\">Featheral Dollar <span>FTH$</span></h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\" data-cms-copy=\"index-html-2195\">The everyday currency of <b>Featheral World</b>. FTH$ runs on its own layer-3 ledger — signed blocks every second, free wallet-signed transfers, and a public file history anyone can replicate.</p>\n  <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n    <a class=\"btn primary\" href=\"/wallet/\">Open FTH$ Wallet</a>\n    <a class=\"btn\" href=\"/explorer/\">Explore the ledger</a>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"chain-pill\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><cms-widget name=\"heroTip\"></cms-widget></p>\n</section>\n<div class=\"cms-document-sections\">\n<section id=\"stats\">\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\n    <h2 data-cms-copy=\"index-html-2771\">Live ledger statistics</h2>\n    <p class=\"row\"><cms-widget name=\"statsUpdated\"></cms-widget> <cms-widget name=\"refreshStats\"></cms-widget></p>\n  </div>\n  <cms-widget name=\"primaryStats\"></cms-widget>\n  <div class=\"grid-2\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"section-head\"><h3 data-cms-copy=\"index-html-3383\">Latest blocks</h3><a class=\"muted\" href=\"/explorer/#/blocks\">All blocks →</a></div>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\"><cms-widget name=\"table-1\"></cms-widget></div>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"section-head\"><h3 data-cms-copy=\"index-html-3777\">Latest transactions</h3><a class=\"muted\" href=\"/explorer/#/transactions\">All transactions →</a></div>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\"><cms-widget name=\"table-2\"></cms-widget></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"section-head\"><h3 data-cms-copy=\"index-html-4183\">Top holders</h3><a class=\"muted\" href=\"/explorer/#/rich-list\">Full rich list →</a></div>\n  <div class=\"table-wrap\"><cms-widget name=\"table-3\"></cms-widget></div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"how\">\n  <h2 data-cms-copy=\"index-html-4594\">How FTH$ works</h2>\n  <div class=\"flow\">\n    <a class=\"flow-step accent-gold\" data-site=\"gold\"><span>Ethereum Mainnet</span><b>FTHG</b><small>Fixed-supply ERC-20. Balances and transfers live only on Ethereum. Open Featheral Gold →</small></a>\n    <div class=\"flow-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⇄</div>\n    <div class=\"flow-step highlight\"><span>Bridge rate</span><cms-widget name=\"rateValue\"></cms-widget><cms-widget name=\"rateNote\"></cms-widget></div>\n    <div class=\"flow-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⇄</div>\n    <div class=\"flow-step\"><span>Layer 3</span><b>FTH$</b><small data-cms-copy=\"index-html-5238\">Native block ledger. Credits are sealed only after the bridge transaction confirms on Mainnet.</small></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cards\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><span class=\"kicker\">01 · Convert</span><h3 data-cms-copy=\"index-html-5450\">FTHG → FTH$</h3><p data-cms-copy=\"index-html-5470\">Convert FTHG on the Ethereum bridge contract. Once the transaction confirms, the writer node seals a <b>CREDIT</b> to your wallet's FTH$ account.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><span class=\"kicker\">02 · Spend &amp; send</span><h3 data-cms-copy=\"index-html-5701\">Free transfers</h3><p data-cms-copy=\"index-html-5724\">Sign a plain-text message in your wallet — no gas. The writer verifies the signature and a strictly increasing nonce, then seals a <b>TRANSFER</b> within about a second.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><span class=\"kicker\">03 · Withdraw</span><h3 data-cms-copy=\"index-html-5971\">FTH$ → FTHG</h3><p data-cms-copy=\"index-html-5991\">Withdrawals are <b>RESERVED</b> on the ledger, paid in FTHG by the bridge on Ethereum, then <b>SETTLED</b> with the Mainnet transaction hash. Cancelled requests are <b>RELEASED</b>.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"ledger\">\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\n    <h2 data-cms-copy=\"index-html-6268\">An open, replicable ledger</h2>\n    <a class=\"muted\" href=\"/explorer/#/files\">Browse ledger files →</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid-2\">\n    <div class=\"panel\">\n      <h3 data-cms-copy=\"index-html-6443\">Storage format</h3>\n      <dl class=\"kv\">\n        <dt>Layout</dt><dd><code>YYYY/YYYY-MM-DD.jsonl</code> — one folder per year, one file per UTC day</dd>\n        <dt>Encoding</dt><dd>One block per line, canonical minified JSON (sorted keys)</dd>\n        <dt>Block hash</dt><dd><code>sha256(canonical({h, t, p, x}))</code> chained via <code>p</code></dd>\n        <dt>Signatures</dt><cms-widget name=\"signingInfo\"></cms-widget>\n        <dt>Topology</dt><dd>One writer node, any number of read replicas</dd>\n      </dl>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"panel\">\n      <h3 data-cms-copy=\"index-html-7056\">Run a read replica</h3>\n      <p class=\"muted\" data-cms-copy=\"index-html-7091\">Replicas pull blocks from <code>/api/v1/fth/sync</code>, re-verify every hash, signature and transaction, and serve the same public API. Past day files are immutable and safe to cache or mirror.</p>\n      <pre class=\"hash\">FTH_LEDGER_MODE=reader\nFTH_LEDGER_UPSTREAM_URL=https://dollar.featheral.com\nFTH_LEDGER_WRITER_PUBLIC_KEY=&lt;writer key&gt;\nnpm start</pre>\n      <cms-widget name=\"fileStats\"></cms-widget>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n</div>",
  "widgets": {
